                                "sense_id": "bbdceed3-ce3a-3aff-b6b1-8ff7104d6b50",
                                "text": "Abnormity was detected during the flight of the rocket, which blasted off at 7:23 p.m. Sunday from Wenchang Space Launch Center in southern province of Hainan."
